    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious box shows up in your office with several enigmatic items inside including a clockwork device sealed from the inside. A journal from the unknown sender describes how to open the device and explore the puzzles contained within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 100 mind-bending levels in this light-based puzzler. Use your mouse to point, click and scroll to use mysterious tools to reflect, bend, filter, separate, mix, split, unblock, teleport, and polarize light to reach the goals.</p>",
